{
  "name": "tidykeep",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "跨 Agent(Claude Code / Codex / Kimi Code)的项目知识保鲜协议分发器:铺设 tidykeep 与 sdlc 两个 Agent Skill、AGENTS.md 唯一规则入口与 STATE.md 设计真相。靠约定执行,不安装任何 hook。",
